{"id":10514,"slug":"10514-diamond-problem-trong-c-la-gi-giai-quyet-bang-cach-nao","category":"C++","subcategory":"OOP","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Diamond problem trong C++ là gì? Giải quyết bằng cách nào?","question_en":"What is the diamond problem in C++? How is it solved?","answer_vi":"Diamond problem xảy ra khi class `D` kế thừa từ `B` và `C`, cả hai đều kế thừa từ `A`. Kết quả: `D` có **2 bản sao** của `A`, gây nhập nhằng.\n\n```\n    A\n   / \\\n  B   C\n   \\ /\n    D\n```\n\n```cpp\nclass A { public: int x; };\nclass B : public A {};\nclass C : public A {};\nclass D : public B, public C {};\n\nD d;\n// d.x;  // lỗi: ambiguous — B::x hay C::x?\n```\n\n**Giải pháp: virtual inheritance** — `A` chỉ tồn tại **1 lần** trong `D`.\n\n```cpp\nclass B : virtual public A {};\nclass C : virtual public A {};\nclass D : public B, public C {};\n\nD d;\nd.x = 5;  // OK — chỉ có một A::x duy nhất\n```\n\nVirtual inheritance tốn thêm overhead (thêm vptr); thường nên tránh diamond bằng cách thiết kế lại (dùng interface/composition).","answer_en":"The diamond problem occurs when class `D` inherits from both `B` and `C`, which both inherit from `A`. Result: `D` gets **two copies** of `A`, causing ambiguity.\n\n```\n    A\n   / \\\n  B   C\n   \\ /\n    D\n```\n\n```cpp\nclass A { public: int x; };\nclass B : public A {};\nclass C : public A {};\nclass D : public B, public C {};\n\nD d;\n// d.x;  // error: ambiguous — B::x or C::x?\n```\n\n**Solution: virtual inheritance** — `A` exists only **once** in `D`.\n\n```cpp\nclass B : virtual public A {};\nclass C : virtual public A {};\nclass D : public B, public C {};\n\nD d;\nd.x = 5;  // OK — only one A::x\n```\n\nVirtual inheritance adds overhead (extra vptr); the usual recommendation is to avoid the diamond by redesigning using interfaces or composition.","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Diamond problem xảy ra khi class <code>D</code> kế thừa từ <code>B</code> và <code>C</code>, cả hai đều kế thừa từ <code>A</code>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Kết quả: <code>D</code> có <strong>2 bản sao</strong> của <code>A</code>, gây nhập nhằng.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"A\n   / \\\n  B   C\n   \\ /\n    D\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">A\n   / \\\n  B   C\n   \\ /\n    D</code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">cpp</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"class A { public: int x; };\nclass B : public A {};\nclass C : public A {};\nclass D : public B, public C {};\n\nD d;\n// d.x;  // lỗi: ambiguous — B::x hay C::x?\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">A</span> { <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span>: <span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> x; };\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">B</span> : <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> A {};\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">C</span> : <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> A {};\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">D</span> : <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> B, <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> C {};\n\nD d;\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// d.x;  // lỗi: ambiguous — B::x hay C::x?</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Giải pháp: virtual inheritance</strong> — <code>A</code> chỉ tồn tại <strong>1 lần</strong> trong <code>D</code>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">cpp</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"class B : virtual public A {};\nclass C : virtual public A {};\nclass D : public B, public C {};\n\nD d;\nd.x = 5;  // OK — chỉ có một A::x duy nhất\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">B</span> : <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">virtual</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> A {};\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">C</span> : <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">virtual</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> A {};\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">D</span> : <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> B, <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> C {};\n\nD d;\nd.x = <span class=\"hljs-number\">5</span>;  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// OK — chỉ có một A::x duy nhất</span></code></pre></div><p>Virtual inheritance tốn thêm overhead (thêm vptr); thường nên tránh diamond bằng cách thiết kế lại (dùng interface/composition).</p>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">The diamond problem occurs when class <code>D</code> inherits from both <code>B</code> and <code>C</code>, which both inherit from <code>A</code>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Result: <code>D</code> gets <strong>two copies</strong> of <code>A</code>, causing ambiguity.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"A\n   / \\\n  B   C\n   \\ /\n    D\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"