lic</span> B, <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> C {};\n\nD d;\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// d.x;  // error: ambiguous — B::x or C::x?</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Solution: virtual inheritance</strong> — <code>A</code> exists only <strong>once</strong> in <code>D</code>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">cpp</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"class B : virtual public A {};\nclass C : virtual public A {};\nclass D : public B, public C {};\n\nD d;\nd.x = 5;  // OK — only one A::x\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">B</span> : <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">virtual</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> A {};\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">C</span> : <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">virtual</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> A {};\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">D</span> : <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> B, <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> C {};\n\nD d;\nd.x = <span class=\"hljs-number\">5</span>;  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// OK — only one A::x</span></code></pre></div><p>Virtual inheritance adds overhead (extra vptr); the usual recommendation is to avoid the diamond by redesigning using interfaces or composition.</p>","references":[{"label":"GeeksforGeeks — Diamond Problem in C++","url":"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/cpp/diamond-problem-in-cpp/"},{"label":"cprogramming.com — Virtual Inheritance in C++","url":"https://www.cprogramming.com/tutorial/virtual_inheritance.html"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/10511-4-tinh-chat-cua-oop-trong-c-la-gi","title":"4 tính chất của OOP trong C++ là gì?"},{"url":"/q/10512-virtual-function-va-pure-virtual-function-khac-nhau-the-nao","title":"Virtual function và pure virtual function khác nhau thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/10513-vtable-virtual-table-hoat-dong-the-nao","title":"Vtable (virtual table) hoạt động thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/10515-khi-nao-constructor-va-destructor-duoc-goi-thu-tu-trong-ke-thua","title":"Khi nào constructor và destructor được gọi? Thứ tự trong kế thừa?"},{"url":"/q/10500-c-khac-c-o-nhung-diem-nao-quan-trong-nhat","title":"C++ khác C ở những điểm nào quan trọng nhất?"},{"url":"/q/10501-tham-chieu-trong-c-la-gi-khac-con-tro-the-nao","title":"Tham chiếu (`&`) trong C++ là gì? Khác con trỏ thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/10502-new-va-malloc-khac-nhau-the-nao","title":"`new` và `malloc` khác nhau thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/10503-stack-va-heap-trong-c-khac-nhau-the-nao","title":"Stack và Heap trong C++ khác nhau thế nào?"}]}